The objectives of this Section are:

- 1) to protect human life and health;

- 2) to minimize damage to public facilities and utilities in floodplains;

- 3) to help maintain a stable tax base by providing for sound use and development of flood prone areas to minimize flood blight,

- 5) to minimize the need for rescue and relief efforts associated with flooding and the expense to the general public;

